core/ui/fonts: font3x5 and font5x7 (gen_fonts.py and the generated font3x5.h / font5x7.h)

The glyphs were drawn for this project (rytm-teensy, 2026-10-16) as ASCII art in gen_fonts.py; they are not
copied or derived from any other font file or device firmware.

To the extent possible under law, the authors have dedicated all copyright and related and neighbouring rights
